Week 1 – Gemini API Integration

about the Project 
In this practical, I connected Python with the Google Gemini API and implemented a simple application to interact with a Large Language Model.

Work Completed
- Configured the Gemini API using an API key.
- Integrated the Google GenAI library with Python.
- Used prompts to generate responses from Gemini.
- Implemented and executed the Python program successfully.

Technologies Used
Python, Google Gemini API, Google GenAI, Python-dotenv.

Execution
python main.py


Output
The application successfully connected to Gemini, accepted the input prompt and displayed an AI-generated response.

Learning Outcome
I learned how to integrate an LLM API into a Python application and generate responses using prompts.
